## Using it day to day

- **Dashboard** → find the customer → **Lock phone**. Within seconds, their
  screen changes to "Locked by Nadeem Mobile" with your message and a Call
  Shop button. Nothing else on the phone is usable.
- When they pay, tap **Unlock phone** — they get their phone back exactly as
  it was, instantly.
- The dashboard also shows who hasn't paired yet, and a running list of
  lock/unlock history per customer.

## A note on customizing the lock screen

The wording, colors, and layout are in:
- `android-app/app/src/main/res/layout/activity_lock.xml` (layout)
- `android-app/app/src/main/res/values/colors.xml` (colors)
- `android-app/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml` (text)

Change `SHOP_NAME` / `SHOP_PHONE` in `server/.env` to update the shop name
and number shown — no need to rebuild the app, it's sent from the server
each time a phone is locked.

