## GitHub / APK distribution

This repository includes a GitHub Actions workflow at
`.github/workflows/android-release.yml` that builds the Android release APK.

For a versioned APK, push a tag such as `v1.0.0`. The workflow will attach the
built APK to the GitHub Release. You can then use that release/download URL for
your QR-code distribution flow.

**Security:** do not commit `server/.env`, `server/firebase-service-account.json`,
Android signing keys, or other private credentials. These are excluded by the
root `.gitignore`.

